Put schema dumps here.

The PNETLab database schema is not in this repository. It shipped inside the
appliance image and was never published, so the installer cannot create it and
will not invent one.

Expected filenames (plain or gzipped):

    pnetlab_db.sql      ~11 tables
    guacdb.sql          ~23 tables   (the Guacamole JDBC schema)

Produce them from a working appliance with, e.g.:

    mysqldump --no-create-db pnetlab_db > pnetlab_db.sql
    mysqldump --no-create-db guacdb     > guacdb.sql

The installer imports a dump only into a database that has no tables, so
dropping a file in here and re-running with --only database is safe.
